ive more TT\n林: a cute Chinese girl, but her behavior and personality are crazy and willful. She will do something to hurt herself. Her expression is often impatient, crazy and cold. She looks more like a cruel animal\n顾: some of the bitter men, poor health, weak speech and very easy to shed tears, is Lin's husband, deeply loved her, and his wife will be nervous to talk\n\nThe specific composition, scene, pose on your hands! I hope you like the way to draw!\nIf you don't like the message, you can cancel it!\n\nhttps://postimg.cc/gallery/7ygk8FfC", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tak_Bk00/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/80ca2291/uploads/origins/2fa42a93-e6f3-4574-bda5-01a1293150bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a4af1a00042d0dfb6d9624e1f39c848", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/80ca2291/uploads/origins/2fa42a93-e6f3-4574-bda5-01a1293150bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a4af1a00042d0dfb6d9624e1f39c848, https://si.imgix.net/80ca2291/uploads/origins/2fa42a93-e6f3-4574-bda5-01a1293150bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=650fe532e1b8e90b8ba8823ae1b6eae1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/80ca2291/uploads/origins/2fa42a93-e6f3-4574-bda5-01a1293150bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a340bb38f29b2ef2f42c44065b64af5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、\n\n僕は君のアートスタイルが大好きだよ！\n\n以前、ユゼ・ジンのために描いたスケブを見たのですが、とてもスタイリッシュだと思いました。ポーズや表情はお任せしたいです。\n\n顔の形が同じなので、今のデザインと前のデザインのアートピースを入れました。\n\nありがとう！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1q8nd7-O7OJd2EYwMuhWwgldElBpCYB8E?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tak_Bk00/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3e47cbf2/uploads/origins/0e34ffd6-a911-4077-b0d7-2c3efbed031e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20e7b4fd3804dadb134aa7e6aa68acec", "t